// The AI of mission ships that their objective flies with move orders (#372): the escort freighter (spec 36), the Mayday victim
// (spec 2431), the Listening Post scout (spec 140) and the Dead in Space carrier (spec 767). No strategy modules. With the vanilla
// Normal AI, its AggroEnemies module took targets on radar: away from the AI origin the ship flew with its hull turned to the target
// (AIAggroEnemiesModule.TacticalRetreat) and crawled, near the origin it flew at the target. Turrets aim on their own, like the Easy AI
// with no targeting list. The dialogue module answers comms.
UpdateInterval = 1

StrategyModules []
TacticsModules []
TargetingModules []
CommsModules = &<./Data/ai/ai_common.rules>/CommsModulesDefault
// An escort in stasis does not move (spec 1851).
StasisModules []
